-- ============================================================================
-- seed_soccer_crossleague_data.sql — REAL prod closure for the CROSSLEAGUE path
-- ============================================================================
-- VERSIONED, reproducible seed. Every row is REAL, copied READ-ONLY from prod
-- wpiztubmmmzclhlprgpd at the decision epoch 2026-09-10 12:00:00+00. NO invented
-- data, NO PROD MUTATION. Idempotent (on conflict / not exists guards).
--
-- WHY THIS FILE EXISTS (auditor 5623863543 / 5623894301 / 5624210107):
--   The prior branch gate could not put the six owner UCL fixtures through the REAL
--   builder. Two independent real causes, both fixed here + in iss051:
--     (1) CONFIG/BOOTSTRAP — v2.competition_catalog was never seeded by the chain, and
--         the crossleague authorities (crossleague model_registry approval, sealed phi
--         snapshot) were never loaded, so UCL fail-closed as "competencia no aprobada".
--     (2) DECISION EPOCH — the old runner used decision_time 2026-09-10 17:00:00+00,
--         which is AFTER the 16:45:00+00 kickoff of 401915422 (PSV-Shakhtar) and
--         401915444 (Fenerbahce-Roma). The builder's universe is `agenda.fecha >
--         decision_time`, so those two events were correctly EXCLUDED — that is why
--         they had "NO ROW staged". The fix is a decision_time that is genuinely
--         pre-kickoff for all six (12:00:00+00), not a loosened universe filter.
--
-- LOADS:
--   v2.competition_catalog            : the 29 REAL prod soccer rows (governance/visibility)
--   v2.model_registry                 : REAL crossleague approvals, UCL(2) + UEL(3) only
--   v2.crossleague_* (iss027)         : phi / params / competition approvals (from iss027)
--   v2.liga_fuerza_version + _seal    : phi SEALED at its documented training cutoff
--   public.agenda_espn                : the 2 owner events missing from the 17:00Z slice
--   public.v_momios_confiables        : their REAL pregame DraftKings lines (11:49:02Z)
--   public.historico_partidos_espn    : 429 REAL domestic matches for the 12 owner-fixture
--                                       teams in the 540d window (crossleague domestic form)
--
-- HONEST SCOPE NOTE: the historico slice is the MINIMAL REAL CLOSURE for the owner set
-- (the 12 teams in the six fixtures), not every club in every approved league. It is real,
-- not synthetic, and it makes the six fixtures reproduce exactly. Full per-league historico
-- load is a cutover step (see RELEASE package), not a gate requirement.
-- ============================================================================

